WEBVTT

00:05:59.672 --> 00:06:04.065
can show this incredible pace
of outpacing us.

00:06:04.089 --> 00:06:08.042
Talk about some of the fields
where there is just vast amounts of data

00:06:08.066 --> 00:06:11.532
and where AI is already showing
remarkable promise.

00:06:11.556 --> 00:06:14.359
KFL: Sure, an example
is machine translation.

00:06:14.882 --> 00:06:16.835
There's a lot of data on the web,

00:06:16.859 --> 00:06:21.311
because we've got all these web pages
with translated versions:

00:06:21.335 --> 00:06:24.037
United Nations proceeds and so on,

00:06:24.061 --> 00:06:27.164
and what the machine-learning
algorithm can do

00:06:27.188 --> 00:06:29.593
is just take these parallel texts

00:06:29.617 --> 00:06:33.741
of French going into English,
Chinese going into Arabic,